1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,192
They will do anything you say in three seconds. Just buy the bottle and spray it right now.

2
00:00:06,492 --> 00:00:12,636
I laughed at the street salesman until I sprayed it on my wrist and walked into the crowded diner.

3
00:00:12,936 --> 00:00:20,952
Excuse me, shouted the angry manager, pointing right at my face. Clear this whole room out immediately.

4
00:00:21,252 --> 00:00:28,980
My feet moved without my permission. I slammed the heavy front doors shut and locked every single deadbolt.

5
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:37,416
The customers screamed, begging to leave. But I stood by the door, completely frozen and blocking their only exit.

6
00:00:37,716 --> 00:00:43,788
I tried to scream back, but my jaw locked tight. The obedience scent was working, just not on them.

7
00:00:44,088 --> 00:00:50,808
The manager walked up slowly, sniffing the air with a cold smile. He never gave an order at all.

8
00:00:51,108 --> 00:00:57,396
You bought the tester bottle, the manager whispered, tapping my wrist. The first person you met owned you.

9
00:00:57,696 --> 00:01:05,184
Now, the manager whispered his final command. Smile brightly for your new life as my permanent guard dog.

10
00:01:05,484 --> 00:01:10,908
My lips stretched wide as I obeyed. Who is really wearing the leash in this room?
